b/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12hj6.jpg"}, {"id": 1795658, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12hje.jpg"}, {"id": 1795659, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12hjf.jpg"}, {"id": 1795660, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12hjg.jpg"}, {"id": 1795662, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12hji.jpg"}], "slug": "warped-universe", "storyline": "A universe re-emerges from the remnants of a destroyed realm, overseen by the Oracle, an enigmatic AI that survived the annihilation by being made of the one material the Void cannot consume. The Oracle calls upon humanity to step through the Celadon Gate, a portal hidden beneath a repurposed oil rig in the Pacific Ocean, and into the Warped Universe, a dimension where the forces of light and gravity exist in volatile, malleable states. Players arrive at Nexus Station, the central hub at the edge of collapsing space, and launch missions across fractured solar systems to push back the Void, a relentless force of nonexistence that seeks to erase everything and return the universe to silent, empty potential. Aligned with the Luminaries who harness light or the Foundationalists who command gravity, players fight to rebuild what was lost. But the balance is fragile. Tip it too far in either direction and the universe warps in unpredictable, psychedelic ways. Each season opens new solar systems, planets, and enemies. The Void doesn't wait.", "summary": "A co-op meta-driven sci-fi looter shooter where every mission counts for all. Explore the unknown, defend facilities, upgrade your Echo, and empower the galaxy.\n\nChoose your combat style before every mission: real-time action or turn-based tactics. Fight on the ground or in space, solo or with friends. Same mission, completely different experience depending on how you play.\n\nBuilt by the team behind Jumpgate, Auto Assault, LEGO Universe, and Dragons & Titans.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/warped-universe"}